NOTE — Where aluminium formwork technology is used to cast concrete for building elements like walls, floors, columns, beams, and slabs, drawings showing precise locations of points and boxes are most important. Similar provisions have to be provided in case of prefabricated concrete works. p) Design electrical installation with due consideration for general characteristics that adhere to protection for safety;
q) Consider the related requirements stated under the Energy Conservation Building Code to qualify buildings under a certain class;
