Regulation 47, Inter-locks and protection for use of electricity at voltage exceeding 650 volts (1) The owner shall ensure the following, namely- (i) isolators and the controlling circuit breakers shall be inter-locked so that the isolators cannot be operated unless the corresponding breaker is in open position;
